  "text": "Some mercenaries sell magical talents to earn a living. While there are many types of mages for hire, some of the sneakiest are specialized in scrying, using their skills for infiltration and sabotage.\n\n---\nWhether they're hired to wage war, protect a caravan, or infiltrate an impenetrable fortress, there's ample work for mercenaries all over Golarion."
